      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.1",
      "source_sha256": "abc038eb98cd1366",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The elder to the beloved Gaius, whom I love in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "7f9ea5e3e27422e5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Beloved, I pray that in all things you may prosper and be at peace, just as your soul prospers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.3",
      "source_sha256": "0841144ffd819f81",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For I rejoiced greatly when the brothers came and testified to your truth, to how you walk in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "685cc9c8a386c898",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I have no greater joy than this: to hear that my children are walking in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.5",
      "source_sha256": "8b56ec81b92d697b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Beloved, you act faithfully in whatever you do for the brothers and for strangers,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.6",
      "source_sha256": "da50c657df339c29",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "who have testified to your love before the churches. You do well to send them on their way in a manner worthy of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.7",
      "source_sha256": "a3afa50843ebfeec",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For they went out for the sake of his name and took nothing from the passers-by."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.8",
      "source_sha256": "da5de0d61ec70621",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "So we ought to receive such people, so that we may become fellow helpers of the truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.9",
      "source_sha256": "7fb935679bdfdd54",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I wrote this to the church, but Diotrephes, who loves to be first among them, does not receive us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.10",
      "source_sha256": "0de9c88e80aefbae",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For this reason, if I come, I will bring up the things he does: he slanders us with evil words. Not content with that, he himself does not receive the brothers, and he also stops those who want to receive them and casts them out of the congregation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.11",
      "source_sha256": "7bcc2f42021aaf7d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Beloved, do not imitate what is evil, but what is good. Whoever does good is from God, but whoever does evil has not seen God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.12",
      "source_sha256": "0ce6993a2fdb6115",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Demetrius has been testified to by everyone, and by the truth itself. We also testify, and you know that our testimony is true."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.13",
      "source_sha256": "adef0b28492685eb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I have much to write to you, but I do not want to write to you with ink and pen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.14",
      "source_sha256": "bdc483964a37997f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For I hope to see you soon, and we will speak face to face."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-d/3john#3John.1.15",
      "source_sha256": "fc0971779fcf8bb8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Peace to you! The friends greet you. Greet those who love us by name."
    }
  ]
}
